<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang=en>
<head>
    <meta charset=UTF-8>
    <meta name=viewport content=width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0>
    <title>Campus Portal - Password Reset Security Notification</title>
    <style>
        {{CSS_CONTENT}}
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class=email-card>
        <div class=email-header>
            <div class=system-notice>Security Dispatch: Official Password Reset Notice</div>
            <h1> {{INSTITUTION_NAME}} </h1>
            <p>Campus Services Portal - Information Security & Identity Office</p>
        </div>

        <div class=email-body>
            <div class=body-title-row>
                <h2>Account Password Reset Request</h2>
                {{STATUS_BADGE}}
            </div>

            <p class=greeting-text>Dear <strong>{{FULL_NAME}}</strong>,</p>

            <p>A password reset request has been initiated for your Campus Services Portal account. If you or an authorized university administrator requested this change, you may set a new password by clicking the secure button below:</p>

            <table class=meta-table>
                <tr>
                    <td class=meta-label>User Category:</td>
                    <td class=meta-value-primary>{{USER_CATEGORY}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class=meta-label>Account Identifier:</td>
                    <td class=meta-value-primary>{{INDEX_NUMBER}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class=meta-label>Account Email:</td>
                    <td class=meta-value-secondary>{{REGISTERED_EMAIL}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class=meta-label>Faculty / Unit:</td>
                    <td>{{FACULTY_NAME}}</td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <div class=action-btn-container>
                <a href={{RESET_URL}} class=action-btn target=_blank>Reset Your Portal Password</a>
            </div>

            <div class=token-box>
                <div class=token-title>Direct Reset Token / Key</div>
                <div class=token-code>{{TOKEN}}</div>
            </div>

            <p class=expiry-text>🔒 This secure reset link and token are valid until: <strong>{{EXPIRES_STR}}</strong> (24 Hours).</p>

            <div class=signoff-block>
                <p>Yours faithfully,</p>
                <p class=signoff-signature>Identity & Access Management Administrator</p>
            </div>

            <hr class=divider />
            <p class=disclaimer-text><strong>Security Advisory:</strong> If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email or report immediately to the University IT Helpdesk. Your existing password will remain active until a new one is confirmed.</p>
        </div>

        <div class=email-footer>
            <p class=footer-title>Campus Services Portal - University Security & Identity Office</p>
            <p>This is an automated system dispatch. Please do not reply directly to this email address.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
